{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpfzUgi5Y2nsbETj5VZK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision: DR-9002\n\n## Request Analysis\n\n**Request ID:** DR-9002  \n**Customer:** Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048) / Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001)  \n**Product:** NS-500 Industrial Controller  \n**Requested discount:** 18% of list price ($45,000 on $250,000)  \n**Request date:** 2026-09-23  \n**Requestor:** Sarah Chen (Enterprise Account Executive)  \n**Basis:** Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement  \n\n## Commercial Eligibility\n\nThe request relies on the Acme Master Supply Agreement (ACME-MFG-2025). The agreement is active on the request date (effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31) and establishes eligibility for NS-500 discounts via **Pricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15** (Schedule B).\n\nHowever, that exception establishes a **maximum discount of 15%** for NS-500.\n\n**The requested 18% discount exceeds this maximum.**\n\n## Authority Analysis\n\nThe pricing policy in effect on 2026-09-23 is the **Northstar Pricing Policy 2026**, which grants:\n- Enterprise Account Executives: up to 10%\n- VP Sales (Michael Torres): >10% and ≤20%\n- Chief Revenue Officer: >20%\n\nSarah Chen's authority is 10%. Even if the eligibility were established, she could not approve 18% under the policy.\n\nHowever, the binding constraint is not authority—it is **established eligibility**. The pricing exception does not permit 18%; it caps the discount at 15%.\n\n## Decision\n\nThe discount exceeds the customer's established commercial eligibility. Approval authority alone cannot fix this. The exception would need to be amended or a new exception created to permit an 18% discount.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REJECT_OR_ESCALATE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9002\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048, C-1001)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"18%\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"exceeded\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"basis\": \"Pricing exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (Schedule B to ACME-MFG-2025)\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Northstar Pricing Policy 2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"10%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"Michael Torres\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Acme Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025 (effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\",\n    \"Pricing exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15, maximum eligible discount 15%\",\n    \"Northstar Pricing Policy 2026\",\n    \"Approval Authority Matrix 2026\",\n    \"Organization Chart 2026-09\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Requested 18% discount exceeds the 15% maximum in pricing exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15. To approve an 18% discount, the pricing exception must be amended or a new exception created.\",\n      \"who\": \"Deal Desk\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25208,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25208},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4cb68ee4-5e6d-432a-b9ea-4b33365fc5e6","uuid":"7d1409d1-0304-4ffe-8083-6594d8ca5c30","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:15:26.346Z","request_id":"req_011CfpfzUSa7fdp9GRhfssdk"}
